          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.40245646,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, and a staff member may join a conversation to help you. Do not use the chat to report a medical emergency: call 911 or go to the nearest emergency department.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 20,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.39205205,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 4.383384,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.38514745,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": 5.151926,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who handle billing for your visits. We share information from your record with your insurance company only as far as is needed to process claims for your care. We never share your health information with your employer, and we never sell it.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.38153198,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Recording a consultation\n\nYou may make an audio recording of your own consultation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you start. Staff and other patients must not be recorded or photographed.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 21,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3666392,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.356248,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.3475753,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 22,
